  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gaza humanitarian response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a result of conflict almost the entire population of Gaza is in need of humanitarian assistance. This intervention targets the people in need with cash as most suitable modality.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gaza humanitarian response  aimed to alleviate the acute humanitarian needs of conflict-affected families
in Gaza, focusing on providing emergency multipurpose cash assistance (EMPCA) and emergency
Water, Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">More than 7,000 families.</narrative>
  </description>
